<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-024" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0000" ref="7e0_f69_1ac">惠帝</persName>時，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0004" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">太尉</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0006" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">王夷甫</persName>言於選者，以弟<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0016" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">澄</persName>為荊州刺史，從弟<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0025" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>為青州刺史。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0032" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">澄</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0034" ref="39o_b6y_n74">敦</persName>俱詣<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0037" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">太尉</persName>辭。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-024-jin043-wangcheng:yangqiu:m0041" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">太尉</persName>謂曰：『今王室將卑，故使弟等居齊、楚之地，外可以建霸業，內足以匡帝室，所望於二弟也！』</p>
</text>
